  "limitations": [
    "The demonstration of the method is based only on a few interviews, requiring a more sophisticated and extended experimental design to verify cross-cultural universality of image-schematic representations.",
    "The study used slides to simulate spatial experiences, suggesting that human subjects should ideally be tested in real-world application space for higher ecological validity.",
